_𝐽𝐼_ ( _𝐴, 𝐵_ ) = 1 indicates that the two sets are exactly the same; conversely, a value of 0 indicates that there is no overlap between the
two sets. Based on _𝐽𝐼_, the cohesion of the module _𝑚𝑖_ responsible
for the class _𝑐𝑖_ is calculated as follows:



